        "text": "commonLift h n d := downLift d ∘ physicalLift h n; in `commonWave` the amplitude is evaluated at `amp (commonLift h n d w)`, i.e. at H, while the phase uses `physicalLift h n w`, i.e. Y_{i(ℓ)}"
